export async function prepareS1SharedImage({fetcher=fetch,decode=async b=>createImageBitmap(new Blob([b])),imageCrop=async(im,x,y,w,h)=>createImageBitmap(im,x,y,w,h),signal}={}){let full=null,crop=null;const check=()=>{if(signal?.aborted)throw Error('S1_SHARED_IMAGE_CANCELLED')},closeFull=()=>{const im=full;full=null;im?.close?.()},closeCrop=()=>{const im=crop;crop=null;im?.close?.()};try{check();const response=await fetcher(new URL('./assets/yeoncho-open.png',import.meta.url),{signal});if(!response.ok)throw Error('S1_SHARED_IMAGE_MISSING');let bytes=new Uint8Array(await response.arrayBuffer());check();if(await hash(bytes)!==SHA)throw Error('S1_SHARED_IMAGE_PIN');check();full=await decode(bytes);bytes=null;check();if(full.width!==4812||full.height!==6709)throw Error('S1_SHARED_IMAGE_DIMENSIONS');crop=await imageCrop(full,0,0,4812,1970);check();if(crop.width!==4812||crop.height!==1970)throw Error('S1_SHARED_CROP_DIMENSIONS');closeFull();check();const token=Object.freeze({}),entry={image:crop,refs:1};crop=null;entries.set(token,entry);let released=false;return Object.freeze({token,dispose(){if(released)return;released=true;release(token,entry)}})}catch(e){try{closeCrop()}catch{}try{closeFull()}catch{}throw e}}
